xpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h2>Jilong KL-6300 Fiber Monster OTDR – Ultra-Long Range Fiber Testing for Bangladesh ISP &amp; Telecom</h2><p>The Jilong KL-6300 Fiber Monster OTDR is a powerful, portable fiber optic tester designed for Bangladesh’s ISP, FTTH, and telecom networks requiring ultra-long distance testing and precise fault detection. Supporting an impressive test range of up to 300 km, this device is ideal for large-scale fiber deployments, long-haul links, and backbone networks. It delivers highly accurate measurements to ensure network reliability and minimize downtime.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Specifications:</h3><ul><li>Test Range: Up to 300 km (depending on fiber type and testing conditions)</li><li>Wavelengths: 850/1300 nm (multimode), 1310/1550/1625 nm (singlemode)</li><li>Dynamic Range: Up to 45 dB</li><li>Event Dead Zone: ≤ 0.8 meters</li><li>Attenuation Dead Zone: ≤ 2.5 meters</li><li>Measurement Accuracy: ±0.1 dB/dB/km (typical)</li><li>Display: 7-inch color touchscreen for detailed analysis</li><li>Battery Life: Up to 12 hours continuous use</li><li>Connectivity: Wi-Fi, GPS, VNC for remote control and data sharing</li><li>Multi-function: Includes Optical Power Meter, Light Source, Visual Fault Locator, and more</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/jilong-280e-fusion-splicer-all-rounder-middle-trunk-line","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Jilong/Jilong-280E-Photoroom-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Jilong 280E Fusion Splicer, All-Rounder, Middle Trunk Line","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Jilong 280E Fusion Splicer, All-Rounder, Middle Trunk Line","now":"103,0